 "exclusions": "The adopted plan's own boundary (Plan-ID 2021004) was not taken from a planning register service; the plan description states that the plan boundary follows the property boundary after the 2022 re-survey of 109/3, so the cadastral teiger stand in for it. The two 109/3 teiger are separated by about 7 m, read as the Vesterliveien road strip that the 197.2 daa plan area also includes. 109/10 (about 0.1 ha inside the plan) is left out of the centroid because it moves it by 1.0 m. No map service, geocoder, kommunekart viewport or village centroid is used."
